#X text 240 83 A mono peak limiter inspired by the classic UREI 1176LN
Peak Limiter. The object emulates the behavior of that hardware unit:
fast peak limiting with a program-dependent release. The limiter is
intended to catch short peaks and prevent them from exceeding the threshold
\, rather than acting as a general-purpose compressor.;
